1. install Docker Desktop
2. install Homebrew for package installation
3. install minikube -> brew install minikube
4. install kubernetes command tools kubectl -> brew install kubectl
5. start minikube -> minikube start --driver=docker
6. install helm for deploy kubernetes pre-build package -> brew install helm
7. install kafka cluster on kubernetes -> helm install kafka oci://registry-1.docker.io/bitnamicharts/kafka
8. to stop kubernetes cluster -> minikube stop



